flowchart LR
  I[ingest] --> D[delegation]
  I --> S[sanctions]
  I --> N[network]
  I --> O[operations]
  I --> H[hallucination]
  N --> V[validator]
  O --> V
  H --> C[council if escalated]
  D --> C
  S --> C
  V --> F[finalize]
  C --> F
  F --> X[trace hash from canonical DAG JSON]
  X --> CH[optional on-chain TraceFinalized event]
